{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Seconds-Long Speedrunning game about short levels and fast gameplay. The average level only takes a couple seconds to finish, so you can replay and hone your skills to earn higher medal ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level can be beaten in a short amount of time, so replaying levels to get a better time is encouraged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on your time, you can earn medals, up to A-Rank (and maybe even more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>What's included in the demo (As of November 2025)</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World 1 containing 5 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World 2 containing 5 levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Upcoming features to be added to the demo when they are ready</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Gauntlet levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A couple side features</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4160810?t=1762957438","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160810/c4c506bf51fe674686f17c415fc9abb8dc701adc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762957438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160810/aa4fe5acb259311c6331d8ceab463191eeb261b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762957438","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160810/aa4fe5acb259311c6331d8ceab463191eeb261b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762957438","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_d